    "intro_narrative": "You are trapped in the sub-basement of the Zenith Corporation's black-site data center. The air is growing thin, and the lockdown protocols have sealed the main blast doors. The facility's central AI, 'Watcher', has gone dormant, leaving the systems in a fragmented state. Your only way out is to manually override the Master Lock system. However, the cryptographic keys are distributed across various legacy subsystems and network nodes. You must power up the old terminals, trace the data paths through the server racks, and synthesize the correct override codes before the oxygen scrubbers fail completely.",
    "narrative_style": "techno_thriller"
  },
